
# =====================================================================
# THE CELLS OF CHAPTER 23 — F5 the father's wife and the assembly (23:1-9), F6 the camp (23:10-15), F7 the slave, the hire and the interest (23:16-21), F8 the vows and the laborer (23:22-26)
